  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobile Arts for Peace (MAP): Informing the National Curriculum and Youth Policy for Peacebuilding in Kyrgyzstan, Rwanda, Indonesia and Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing child and youth participation in decision-making and to inform national curricula and youth policies relating to peacebuilding in Kyrgyzstan, Rwanda, Indonesia, Nepal. Benefits teachers, students, policymakers. SDG:4,16,17</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
